@startuml
title Deployment Diagram
node "Staff / Lab Workstation" {
  artifact "fraud-system.jar" as JAR
  node "Java Runtime Environment 17+" as JRE {
    component "Online Banking Fraud Detection and Monitoring System" as APP
  }
}
node "Operator Terminal (stdin / stdout)" as TERM
TERM --> APP : menu commands
JAR ..> APP : deployed as
note bottom of JRE
  In-memory state only.
  No external database required.
end note
@enduml
